	(text "TPS7A2033 3.3 V +/-1.5 % (line, load 1-300 mA, -40..125 C): 3.2505-3.3495 V. TPS3850G33 releases\nRESET at <= 3.2189 V (3.168 V +0.8 % +0.8 % hysteresis) and trips OV at >= 3.4045 V: margins\n31.6 mV / 55.0 mV (check_3v3, every build; CSR-02). Load < 0.1 A, 0.2 W."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254.188 148.064 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9ece5285-73db-5a43-b5f0-9ee99fe9b3f2")
	)
	(text "TPS16630 ILIM 9.09k -> 1.98 A (1.84-2.12 A): CTRL logic + port board (CTRL feeds it via a 1.1 A PTC).\nSHDN open = on (internal pull-up): CTRL power does not depend on this board's 3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 92.164 0)
		(effects
